# NOTE: this is a Netlify file and only affects the Netlify demo deploy. The
# production site is served by nginx, which ignores it — the real 301s for
# these paths live in deploy/nginx-hotelsircle.conf.example. Change both.
#
# Retired public URLs. "Vendor" is the internal name for these records; the
# pages have always been branded Partners. 301 so search engines and bookmarks
# follow, rather than relying on the in-app <Navigate> bounce alone.
/vendors           /hospitality-partners  301!
/register/vendor   /register/partner      301!

# SPA fallback — must stay last, Netlify matches in order.
/*    /index.html   200
